# Route: guide 21 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 42 to
# 44, 37 quests, 3.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Shen'dralas, Desolace, Alterac Mountains, Stranglethorn Vale): Valley
# of Bones -> Gelkis Village -> Magram Village -> Gelkis Village -> Nijel's
# Point -> Chillwind Point -> Gallows' Corner -> Ruins of Alterac ->
# Strahnbrad -> Gallows' Corner -> Corrahn's Dagger -> The Headland ->
# Lordamere Internment Camp -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Khan Hratha (1380; Khan Hratha
# 42); Shadowshard Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard
# Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); The Perenolde Tiara (543;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (735; Grel'borg
# the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Legends of Maraudon (7044), The Pariah's Instructions
# (7067), Starving Arcane (92457), Heart of Disruption (92458), Past Due
# (96800), Past Due (96800).

